{"title":"The Official Map of the Star Wars Galaxy","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/the-official-map-of-the-star-wars-galaxy","date":1757004516000,"content":"\n        <p>Lucasfilm recently released <a href=\"https://www.starwars.com/star-wars-galaxy-map\">an official map of the galaxy that Star Wars takes place in</a>. And it’s <em>huge</em>.</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/star-wars-galaxy-map.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/star-wars-galaxy-map.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/star-wars-galaxy-map.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1681\" alt=\"Star Wars Galaxy Map\" /></p>\n\n<p>The map is slightly interactive; you can zoom and scroll it, but you can’t search or, say, click to highlight all the star systems featured in Andor. But you can do manual lookups using <a href=\"https://cdnvideo.dolimg.com/cdn_assets/ff2066584bf86e5376fdfc3b26f0479b8795c403.pdf\">this massive 59-page PDF listing of Star Wars star systems</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Star%20Wars\">Star Wars</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/the-official-map-of-the-star-wars-galaxy\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"55f3eeae44c5a0692749204647ea80f0d6e26c809e4ad75a76b150873ae4bd1c","category":"Sites"}